
## Sequence Detector - Mealy FSM
## Target FPGA: Nexys A7 Artix-7
## Clock Frequency: 100 MHz

## Clock Input
set_property PACKAGE_PIN E3 [get_ports clk]
set_property IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33 [get_ports clk]
create_clock -period 10.000 -name sys_clk [get_ports clk]

## Reset Input - Center Push Button
set_property PACKAGE_PIN N17 [get_ports reset]
set_property IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33 [get_ports reset]

## Serial Data Input - Switch SW0
set_property PACKAGE_PIN J15 [get_ports din]
set_property IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33 [get_ports din]

## Detection Output - LED LD0
set_property PACKAGE_PIN H17 [get_ports detected]
set_property IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33 [get_ports detected]
